n tech: Robotics on the rise", "source_id": "SOURCE-A2ACD47DEF6753C0C5794D17", "temporal_status": "past", "text": "Mave raises $34M to pull existing security tools into one agentic system Elsewhere in tech: Robotics on the rise"}, {"claim_status": "directly_stated", "event_id": "EVENT-74B4B1DA5C2641AC93AA2B6A", "evidence_id": "EVID-FCDF61E5D8AE4E09996C8C40", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "This delay eventually contributed to a $250 million settlement over claims regarding how Apple marketed the AI capabilities of the iPhone 16.", "source_id": "SOURCE-392C85359B48D5AD0909242D", "temporal_status": "past", "text": "This delay eventually contributed to a $250 million settlement over claims regarding how Apple marketed the AI capabilities of the iPhone 16."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-B4F20836B85BE9160BA94913", "evidence_type": "modelled_estimate", "source_excerpt": "Most AI chatbots won't outright tell you who to vote for, but some of the models behind them will.", "source_id": "SOURCE-0D0D2D606F7720D9C5DA55D0", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Most AI chatbots won't outright tell you who to vote for, but some of the models behind them will."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-C8B5F8167DE1F3BDD749C9DC", "evidence_type": "institutional_analysis", "source_excerpt": "IMF Warns of the Real AI Threat: Debt - Slashdot", "source_id": "SOURCE-709A25E00F9B8B92EC7D2EDC", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "IMF Warns of the Real AI Threat: Debt - Slashdot"}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-3995F44C386983F929AE1220", "evidence_type": "institutional_analysis", "source_excerpt": "IMF Warns of the Real AI Threat: Debt (imf.org) 65", "source_id": "SOURCE-709A25E00F9B8B92EC7D2EDC", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "IMF Warns of the Real AI Threat: Debt (imf.org) 65"}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-2B5598106585551951374935", "evidence_type": "institutional_analysis", "source_excerpt": "\"Along with the dangers of continuing cyberattacks , the International Monetary Fund (IMF) reports that the threat of an AI market crash is putting the global markets at risk ,\" writes Slashdot reader databasecowgirl , citing the IMF's latest semiannual Global Financial Stability Report.", "source_id": "SOURCE-709A25E00F9B8B92EC7D2EDC", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "\"Along with the dangers of continuing cyberattacks , the International Monetary Fund (IMF) reports that the threat of an AI market crash is putting the global markets at risk ,\" writes Slashdot reader databasecowgirl , citing the IMF's latest semiannual Global Financial Stability Report."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-B324E2668A12BCE35ACA3D85", "evidence_type": "forecast", "source_excerpt": "And while Altman defended a \"morally binding\" AI safety accord that Trump signed with tech CEOs last week as a great start for the industry, he predicted calls for guardrails will continue and said he would \"welcome something more.\" He also said he shares the concerns of those who worry AI rules are being crafted by the White House and tech executives without input from Congress or the public.", "source_id": "SOURCE-03263141D95195A4627766DF", "temporal_status": "future", "text": "And while Altman defended a \"morally binding\" AI safety accord that Trump signed with tech CEOs last week as a great start for the industry, he predicted calls for guardrails will continue and said he would \"welcome something more.\" He also said he shares the concerns of those who worry AI rules are being crafted by the White House and tech executives without input from Congress or the public."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-992DFFE255CCD0B517424A6B", "evidence_type": "institutional_analysis", "source_excerpt": "A safety engineer who recently quit ChatGPT creator OpenAI warned Saturday that artificial intelligence (AI) firms were \"not being nearly careful enough.\"", "source_id": "SOURCE-7CDEDAD35C8926AAE2298702", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "A safety engineer who recently quit ChatGPT creator OpenAI warned Saturday that artificial intelligence (AI) firms were \"not being nearly careful enough.\""}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-31179F058F4E03ADE2A42E5F", "evidence_type": "modelled_estimate", "source_excerpt": "Robinson, who oversaw safety reports for 12 frontier AI-model launches, said the recent errors were typical because tech giants are prioritizing \"speed and flexibility.\"", "source_id": "SOURCE-7CDEDAD35C8926AAE2298702", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Robinson, who oversaw safety reports for 12 frontier AI-model launches, said the recent errors were typical because tech giants are prioritizing \"speed and flexibility.\""}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-8D6EB2291CFB42A2237722D1", "evidence_type": "institutional_analysis", "source_excerpt": "World Labs was founded by AI researcher Fei-Fei Li, who is widely seen as an AI pioneer as a Stanford professor, and who previously worked for Google leading AI research.", "source_id": "SOURCE-F2EDABE4A0A6019CA444B612", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "World Labs was founded by AI researcher Fei-Fei Li, who is widely seen as an AI pioneer as a Stanford professor, and who previously worked for Google leading AI research."}, {"claim_status": null, "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "MEM-EVID-CF05EB3A619B93260E9A0F60", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "After the gathering at the White House, Trump posted a document that he called a \"morally binding\" agreement that would serve as a \"form of protection\" from AI's potential risks.", "source_id": "SOURCE-B27664E370409D93C935C9AB", "temporal_status": null, "text": "After the gathering at the White House, Trump posted a document that he called a \"morally binding\" agreement that would serve as a \"form of protection\" from AI's potential risks."}, {"claim_status": null, "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "MEM-EVID-34AA4AEAA170135C1C2839F5", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "On Tuesday, US President Donald Trump hosted a meeting of top technology bosses - including leaders from OpenAI, Anthropic, Nvidia, SpaceX, Meta and Google - to discuss AI.", "source_id": "SOURCE-B27664E370409D93C935C9AB", "temporal_status": null, "text": "On Tuesday, US President Donald Trump hosted a meeting of top technology bosses - including leaders from OpenAI, Anthropic, Nvidia, SpaceX, Meta and Google - to discuss AI."}, {"claim_status": null, "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "MEM-EVID-859A2E0C29E9D1F98890B5C6", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "President Trump gathered top artificial intelligence leaders in Washington on Tuesday and doubled down on his opposition to government intervention, suggesting that \"self-regulation\" is the answer to growing worries about the technology getting out of human control.", "source_id": "SOURCE-F2713022315255015DAEF71D", "temporal_status": null, "text": "President Trump gathered top artificial intelligence leaders in Washington on Tuesday and doubled down on his opposition to government intervention, suggesting that \"self-regulation\" is the answer to growing worries about the technology getting out of human control."}, {"claim_status": null, "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "MEM-EVID-25D92D47AAE701706599F987", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "President Trump speaks with Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang and others during a meeting with technology executives about artificial intelligence in the East Room of the White House on Sept. 29.", "source_id": "SOURCE-F2713022315255015DAEF71D", "temporal_status": null, "text": "President Trump speaks with Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang and others during a meeting with technology executives about artificial intelligence in the East Room of the White House on Sept. 29."}, {"claim_status": null, "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "MEM-EVID-5AB3DE7E822691295FEBB259", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "President Donald Trump on Tuesday announced that the US government would rename artificial intelligence \"super intelligence\" in official communications, as world leaders jostled over how to address the dangers of the fast-advancing technology.", "source_id": "SOURCE-7EA7844C9D194FECD5069C88", "temporal_status": null, "text": "President Donald Trump on Tuesday announced that the US government would rename artificial intelligence \"super intelligence\" in official communications, as world leaders jostled over how to address the dangers of the fast-advancing technology."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-1419971820F164C837933207", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "Anthropic , Google and OpenAI aim to launch a standards body focused on artificial intelligence (AI) by the end of this year or early next year, The Information reported Thursday (Sept. 24), citing unnamed sources.", "source_id": "SOURCE-3112A158BFE36AC1CAC41132", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Anthropic , Google and OpenAI aim to launch a standards body focused on artificial intelligence (AI) by the end of this year or early next year, The Information reported Thursday (Sept. 24), citing unnamed sources."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-BF69D9417CED98DE228AF5EF", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "They initially aimed to form a public-private partnership, but that effort stalled in the Trump administration, according to the report.", "source_id": "SOURCE-3112A158BFE36AC1CAC41132", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "They initially aimed to form a public-private partnership, but that effort stalled in the Trump administration, according to the report."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-A5E6571233414CD5E71D2DBF", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "The standards body would support third-party organizations that test models before they are deployed, would detail how AI developers should report safety and security incidents, would define the labs' voluntary safety and security commitments, and would establish qualifications for independent auditors of models and labs, the report said.", "source_id": "SOURCE-3112A158BFE36AC1CAC41132", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "The standards body would support third-party organizations that test models before they are deployed, would detail how AI developers should report safety and security incidents, would define the labs' voluntary safety and security commitments, and would establish qualifications for independent auditors of models and labs, the report said."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-245A149FE0C97FAB74844B4F", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "The White House Accord on Super Intelligence was signed on September 29 by executives from Google, Anthropic, Meta, OpenAI, xAI, and NVIDIA.", "source_id": "SOURCE-34DAD6C0566224EE443C2C91", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "The White House Accord on Super Intelligence was signed on September 29 by executives from Google, Anthropic, Meta, OpenAI, xAI, and NVIDIA."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-EBAACD8E95EA95393688FFFD", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "Six major AI companies have agreed to voluntary safety commitments with the White House, establishing internal controls, independent audits, and board-level oversight for advanced AI models.", "source_id": "SOURCE-34DAD6C0566224EE443C2C91", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Six major AI companies have agreed to voluntary safety commitments with the 