": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "Asked whether it was binding, the President said, \"I think it's morally binding,\" according to CBS News.", "source_id": "SOURCE-5F4AF27BB413D1A1D56AF783", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Asked whether it was binding, the President said, \"I think it's morally binding,\" according to CBS News."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-59F53A081F442C5F986BEB86", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "AMD has named OneQode as a cloud service provider in the AMD InstinctTM GPU Evaluation Program.", "source_id": "SOURCE-552AE9272E342EEEDF1A5B54", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "AMD has named OneQode as a cloud service provider in the AMD InstinctTM GPU Evaluation Program."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-A54067BEBF3AC05BCF92D89D", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "Here is a number to sit with: $10 billion . That is what investors now say a personal AI assistant called Instinct is worth, after it raised a $1 billion Series C led by Sequoia Capital, with Benchmark and Coatue along for the ride ( Pulse 2.0 ).", "source_id": "SOURCE-CA5042B5CC34665658BF9040", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Here is a number to sit with: $10 billion . That is what investors now say a personal AI assistant called Instinct is worth, after it raised a $1 billion Series C led by Sequoia Capital, with Benchmark and Coatue along for the ride ( Pulse 2.0 )."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-9183955DB4D75E6146CE27D5", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "Roughly one month earlier, Instinct had raised a $250 million Series B at a $2.5 billion valuation , co-led by Index Ventures and Benchmark ( Layer3 Labs ).", "source_id": "SOURCE-CA5042B5CC34665658BF9040", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Roughly one month earlier, Instinct had raised a $250 million Series B at a $2.5 billion valuation , co-led by Index Ventures and Benchmark ( Layer3 Labs )."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-3CE5C86ABCE9E31CA3140AB5", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "What makes that leap unusual: Instinct still runs invite-only, has not shipped a mobile app, and has disclosed zero user numbers and zero revenue ( Phemex ).", "source_id": "SOURCE-CA5042B5CC34665658BF9040", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "What makes that leap unusual: Instinct still runs invite-only, has not shipped a mobile app, and has disclosed zero user numbers and zero revenue ( Phemex )."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-F569722D104741B0E18AA760", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "\"We're building Instinct to be the best personal agent that can handle the deeply personal nuances of everyday life. This funding helps us bring Instinct to more people and continue building the future of personal AI.\" - Noah Shinn, founder of Instinct", "source_id": "SOURCE-CA5042B5CC34665658BF9040", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "\"We're building Instinct to be the best personal agent that can handle the deeply personal nuances of everyday life. This funding helps us bring Instinct to more people and continue building the future of personal AI.\" - Noah Shinn, founder of Instinct"}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-84ED1B9DC5B5B0065923391B", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "Cloud and security giant Akamai on Tuesday announced plans to acquire application programming interface (API) protection company Noname Security.", "source_id": "SOURCE-9C9B8123C6BC102F070C7E61", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Cloud and security giant Akamai on Tuesday announced plans to acquire application programming interface (API) protection company Noname Security."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-77D56FF6D9ACFA284B74AD74", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "Research shows that 50.7% of organizations rely on public AI tools such as ChatGPT and Copilot but only 20.2% report enterprise-wide AI deployments built on a governed framework.", "source_id": "SOURCE-31FBFB78F9282C827C68A7D2", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Research shows that 50.7% of organizations rely on public AI tools such as ChatGPT and Copilot but only 20.2% report enterprise-wide AI deployments built on a governed framework."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-6202AF36A7385CE7A8B303B5", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "Under a partnership, the Simons Foundation, Anthropic and OpenAI will commit $15 million in combined funding and resources.", "source_id": "SOURCE-F81BAC1883B01771CD02CC09", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Under a partnership, the Simons Foundation, Anthropic and OpenAI will commit $15 million in combined funding and resources."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-F85EDA8DD5FBADAAF9AFCF88", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "Anthropic and OpenAI will also provide AI tools and computing resources to a select group of researchers supported by the Simons Foundation, extending beyond mathematics to include basic science.", "source_id": "SOURCE-F81BAC1883B01771CD02CC09", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Anthropic and OpenAI will also provide AI tools and computing resources to a select group of researchers supported by the Simons Foundation, extending beyond mathematics to include basic science."}, {"claim_status": "reported_claim", "event_id": "", "evidence_id": "EVID-2B662527CB207440B1310128", "evidence_type": "source_excerpt", "source_excerpt": "Voluntary Environmental Commitments go beyond mandatory regulations and allow companies to adopt specific commitments to reduce their environmental footprint. In other words, organizations propose appropriate technical solutions and self-imposing commitments that, once acquired, cease to be voluntary, and the company is obliged to comply with them.", "source_id": "SOURCE-A144B5DF8458E92CC9CAC3D8", "temporal_status": "unknown", "text": "Voluntary Environmental Commitments go beyond mandatory regulations and allow companies to adopt specific commitments to reduce their environmental footprint. In other words, organizations propose appropriate technical solutions and self-imposing commitments that, once acquired, cease to be voluntary, and the company is obliged to comply with them."}], "forecast_followups": {"open": [], "resolved": [], "summary": {"check_failures": 0, "checked_with_new_evidence": 0, "contradicted": 0, "deferred_due_check_budget": 0, "expired": 0, "observed": 0, "open_before": 0, "persisted": false, "recorded_this_run": 0, "still_open": 0, "version": "forecast-followup-v2"}, "track_record": {"counts": {}, "decided": 0, "observed_share": null}}, "grounding_by_insight": {"INSIGHTREV-2B67888E65A4F9CCE789BA13": {"claim_count": 1, "claims": [{"attribution_valid": true, "citation_valid": true, "cited_evidence_ids": ["EVID-6FED6EAF5E10A1BE0845C753", "EVID-41CC34E7372A3FAC8D976C8F", "EVID-6710BDB7A5A076547782678B", "EVID-1419971820F164C837933207", "EVID-6202AF36A7385CE7A8B303B5", "EVID-F85EDA8DD5FBADAAF9AFCF88", "EVID-C73C20FD74852CFF04D3CDEE", "EVID-2B662527CB207440B1310128"], "claim_id": "INSIGHTREV-2B67888E65A4F9CCE789BA13-INSIGHT-01", "claim_text": "While President Donald Trump signed a voluntary AI safety accord and OpenAI publicly affirmed it pauses training or holds back models when needed to safely manage capability, OpenAI simultaneously committed $15 million in combined funding and resources with Anthropic and the Simons Foundation. [ASSUMPTION] Because federal safety frameworks rely on voluntary commitments without statutory enforcement thresholds, model providers retain exclusive discretion over operational pause triggers. [