7.5B valuation", "what_to_watch": ["Independent confirmation: only one source in this run reports it.", "Follow-up: reported at one point in time so far; watch for later reports.", "Problems: delays, criticism, legal or regulatory pushback."]}, {"actors": ["Kalaari Capital"], "development_id": "DEVELOPMENT-8B21F87C91E80385", "event_ids": ["EVENT-03523FBBE64A55604A3C8280"], "events_found_by_follow_up_search": 0, "facts": [{"date": "2026-10-25", "event_id": "EVENT-03523FBBE64A55604A3C8280", "evidence_id": "EVID-0D6E659CC6600FDF9581B418", "found_by_follow_up_search": false, "source_id": "SOURCE-EB3FDA9CBE881286E0AB7F14", "text": "Read more here about how it works with enterprise brands across 25 countries, with investment from Kalaari Capital and Kettleborough VC."}, {"date": "2026-10-25", "event_id": "EVENT-03523FBBE64A55604A3C8280", "evidence_id": "EVID-A407D65F2334BD2A7C82E1B6", "found_by_follow_up_search": false, "source_id": "SOURCE-EB3FDA9CBE881286E0AB7F14", "text": "Founded by Karthik Venkateswaran, Nandha Kumar Ravi, Sundar Natesan, and Mukund Srivathsan, Zocket leverages AI for consumer brands."}], "kind": "single_event", "sources": [{"published_at": "2026-10-25 05:58:29", "publisher": "yourstory.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-EB3FDA9CBE881286E0AB7F14", "title": "Test your business creativity with Edition 255 of our weekly quiz!", "url": "https://yourstory.com/2026/10/business-creativity-quiz-education-entrepreneur"}], "title": "Read more here about how it works with enterprise brands across 25 countries, with investment from Kalaari Capital and Kettleborough VC.", "what_to_watch": ["Independent confirmation: only one source in this run reports it.", "Follow-up: reported at one point in time so far; watch for later reports.", "Others: no other company reported doing the same in this run.", "Problems: delays, criticism, legal or regulatory pushback."]}], "editorial_briefing": {"analogies": [], "case_count": 2, "context_fact_count": 10, "expected_implications": [{"a