companies are raising massive, multi-hundred-million-dollar funding rounds at multi-billion-dollar valuations.", "uncertainty": "It is unclear whether these valuations require immediate enterprise revenue to sustain, or if they are purely capitalization for compute infrastructure."}], "counterevidence_and_alternative_explanations": [{"alternative_id": "ALT-0FB35A2C727F60648C06FB70", "evidence_ids": [], "status": "unresolved", "text": "OpenAI could voluntarily adopt strict independent third-party audit standards despite the lack of federal mandate."}, {"evidence_ids": ["EVID-2B662527CB207440B1310128"], "source_id": "SOURCE-A144B5DF8458E92CC9CAC3D8", "text": "Voluntary Environmental Commitments go beyond mandatory regulations and allow companies to adopt specific commitments to reduce their environmental footprint. In other words, organizations propose appropriate technical solutions and self-imposing commitments that, once acquired, cease to be voluntary, and the company is obliged to comply with them.", "type": "counterevidence"}], "critical_unknowns": ["Whether Congress will introduce legislation creating binding statutory safety standards for AI developers.", "Research is incomplete; absence of an alternative has not been established. Some competing evidence was found and must be weighed."], "developments_to_watch": [{"actors": ["Donald Trump"], "development_id": "DEVELOPMENT-CA316E96E80FFDD9", "event_ids": ["EVENT-D52422919309DC6A9B2ED92D", "EVENT-332C5C4DB349311C2DF10A50", "EVENT-BD5B08D085BC874ABD4DF73C"], "events_found_by_follow_up_search": 2, "facts": [{"date": "2026-09-29", "event_id": "EVENT-D52422919309DC6A9B2ED92D", "evidence_id": "EVID-0DC136A2E375A52FEB666C15", "found_by_follow_up_search": false, "source_id": "SOURCE-EB578AFA52D107B33EFE3B0A", "text": "Later Tuesday, Trump said the major artificial intelligence companies had agreed to a voluntary framework featuring internal and external reviews."}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "event_id": "EVENT-332C5C4DB349311C2DF10A50", "evidence_id": "EVID-C73C20FD74852CFF04D3CDEE", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-7CDEDAD35C8926AAE2298702", "text": "Days after US President Donald Trump signed a voluntary pact with artificial intelligence giants, a former OpenAI worker said his industry needs the same safeguards as nuclear power or aviation."}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "event_id": "EVENT-332C5C4DB349311C2DF10A50", "evidence_id": "EVID-009306C530744BA60D341FD7", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-7CDEDAD35C8926AAE2298702", "text": "This week, Trump announced a voluntary safety pact with six companies - Nvidia, SpaceX, OpenAI, Anthropic, Meta and Alphabet's Google."}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "event_id": "EVENT-BD5B08D085BC874ABD4DF73C", "evidence_id": "EVID-6710BDB7A5A076547782678B", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-101AF2DC47D2862B42B578B9", "text": "Standing with the world's richest and most powerful tech executives Tuesday outside the West Wing, President Donald Trump said that he and they had signed a voluntary accord intended to ensure the industry develops AI safely."}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "event_id": "EVENT-BD5B08D085BC874ABD4DF73C", "evidence_id": "EVID-050FD140D23F4ED2F23C8D34", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-101AF2DC47D2862B42B578B9", "text": "The CEOs of Google, Anthropic, Meta, Nvidia, xAI and OpenAI President Greg Brockman signed onto the accord."}], "kind": "shared_development", "sources": [{"published_at": "2026-09-29 14:42:17", "publisher": "newsweek.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-EB578AFA52D107B33EFE3B0A", "title": "Donald Trump launches new AI government website: What to know", "url": "https://www.newsweek.com/trump-launches-america-gov-ai-government-website-12501100"}, {"published_at": "2026-10-03 21:55:10.82800", "publisher": "dw.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-7CDEDAD35C8926AAE2298702", "title": "AI giants not 'careful enough,' ex-OpenAI engineer warns", "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/ai-giants-not-being-nearly-careful-enough-warns-outgoing-openai-safety-engineer/a-79533080"}, {"published_at": "2026-09-29 13:45:03", "publisher": "yahoo.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-101AF2DC47D2862B42B578B9", "title": "Trump urges public to trust industry self-policing of AI technology", "url": "https://www.yahoo.com/news/politics/articles/white-house-trump-pitch-ai-121339265.html"}], "title": "Signing a voluntary safety agreement for AI technology", "what_to_watch": ["Size: the collected articles give no figures (money, capacity, users).", "Others: no other company reported doing the same in this run.", "Problems: delays, criticism, legal or regulatory pushback."]}, {"actors": ["Instinct"], "development_id": "DEVELOPMENT-DFA152E9A5EA4F5F", "event_ids": ["EVENT-1B485A67366B881A483EBFFD", "EVENT-229A6F9354620A25698B44AC"], "events_found_by_follow_up_search": 2, "facts": [{"date": "2026-09-28", "event_id": "EVENT-1B485A67366B881A483EBFFD", "evidence_id": "EVID-2C40C561C23400D881736B5E", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-5D99A09A1DF6AAAA4C6127F6", "text": "Instinct , the developer of an artificial intelligence assistant for everyday users, today announced it has raised a colossal $1 billion in a new funding, bringing the company's valuation to $10 billion."}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "event_id": "EVENT-1B485A67366B881A483EBFFD", "evidence_id": "EVID-2BAE462CF3AAA7D1EC120B64", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-5D99A09A1DF6AAAA4C6127F6", "text": "The funding comes a month after the company said it raised $250 million, co-led by Index Ventures and Benchmark, valuing the company at $2.5 billion at the time."}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "event_id": "EVENT-229A6F9354620A25698B44AC", "evidence_id": "EVID-1DBD67DA5901CF0442294570", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-5D99A09A1DF6AAAA4C6127F6", "text": "Instinct , the developer of an artificial intelligence assistant for everyday users, today announced it has raised a 