ial intelligence model, today announced that it has raised $870 million in funding at a $7.5 billion valuation."}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "event_id": "EVENT-0AFC3CE3767CB932A8BC9370", "evidence_id": "EVID-AE53BF94EFC0F8D3B4901E86", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-5CA600E85547A37DD2382A5D", "text": "Additionally, the company plans to roll out unspecified \"enterprise features\" that will make it easier for large organizations to use its models."}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "event_id": "EVENT-541D37BE175B9F1BC6B1C27C", "evidence_id": "EVID-BBBF814CF2F592FBF57FB9A8", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-5CA600E85547A37DD2382A5D", "text": "TypeSafe Inc., the creator of the Jev artificial intelligence model, today announced that it has raised $870 million in funding at a $7.5 billion valuation."}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "event_id": "EVENT-541D37BE175B9F1BC6B1C27C", "evidence_id": "EVID-7096C0555041ADE5FD6FEF39", "found_by_follow_up_search": true, "source_id": "SOURCE-5CA600E85547A37DD2382A5D", "text": "The cash infusion comes less than a month after TypeSafe launched Jev."}], "kind": "shared_development", "sources": [{"published_at": "2026-10-09 20:13:11", "publisher": "siliconangle.com", "source_id": "SOURCE-5CA600E85547A37DD2382A5D", "title": "Jev creator TypeSafe closes $870M round at $7.5B valuation - SiliconANGLE", "url": "https://siliconangle.com/2026/10/09/jev-creator-typesafe-closes-870m-round-at-7-5b-valuation/"}], "title": "TypeSafe raising $870M at a $7.5B valuation", "what_to_watch": ["Independent confirmation: only one source in this run reports it.", "Follow-up: reported at one point in time so far; watch for later reports.", "Problems: delays, criticism, legal or regulatory pushback."]}, {"actors": ["Kalaari Capital"], "development_id": "DEVELOPMENT-8B21F87C91E80385", "event_ids": ["EVENT-03523FBBE64A55604A3C8280"], "events_found_by_follow_up_search": 0, "facts": [{"date": "2026-10-25", "event_id": "EVENT-03523FBBE64