els of air traffic and energy grids, said today it has scored $325 million in a Series C funding, bringing its valuation to a cool $3 billion.", "unit": "USD", "value": "3 billion"}], "source_id": "SOURCE-101FE3CF30E589C71CD6D351", "strategic_cluster_id": "dev_energy_asi_series", "strategic_event_class": "financing", "strategic_materiality_score": 4.3, "strategic_topic_relevance_score": 3.0, "summary": "AI infrastructure management software startup ASI hits $3B valuation after raising $325M in funding - SiliconANGLE AI infrastructure management software startup ASI hits $3B valuation after raising $325M in funding by Mike Wheatley An artificial intelligence startup called ASI Inc. , which builds complex models of air traffic and energy grids, said today it has scored $325 million in a Series C funding, bringing its valuation to a cool $3 billion. The round was led by Spark Capital and joined by participants including Citadel Securities, Craft Ventures, Meritech Capital, Energy Impact Partners and Andreessen Horowitz. Today we announced our $325M Series C to scale America's... pic.twitter.com/l133h8H92E", "temporal_status": "past", "text": "AI infrastructure management software startup ASI hits $3B valuation after raising $325M in funding - SiliconANGLE AI infrastructure management software startup ASI hits $3B valuation after raising $325M in funding by Mike Wheatley An artificial intelligence startup called ASI Inc Named actor(s): ASI Inc.. Key quantified detail(s): funding amount: 325 million USD; valuation: 3 billion USD. Timing stated in source: today", "title": "AI infrastructure management software startup ASI hits $3B valuation after raising $325M in funding - SiliconANGLE", "underlying_event_id": "UNDERLYINGEVENT-2679C1F36106C3012A8E0896", "underlying_event_member_count": 1}, {"actors": ["Donald Trump", "voluntary safety pact"], "event_id": "EVENT-332C5C4DB349311C2DF10A50", "event_time_text": "This week", "event_type": "signing of voluntary pact", "evidence_